      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vic%C3%A1lvaro",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1990s a second center, Valdebernardo, was built just west of Vicálvaro’s historic core.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
